    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000rdan](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000rdan) Magnitude 5.5 earthquake at 70.085 depth occurred on Sep 27 2025 41km S of Liteu. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -13.7968 longitude 166.6671. It impacted 434 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
